        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Duelyst: Blitz</strong> is a <strong>lightning-fast</strong> reimagining of the beloved tactical card battler Duelyst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029020/extras/039e9cf1546de59399cf6490294f8f10.avif?t=1761073481\" width=1278 height=394 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dynamic, turn-based duels where every move matters. With a streamlined <strong>6-mana cap</strong> and a consistent <strong>2-card draw</strong> each turn, <strong>Duelyst: Blitz</strong> delivers tight, decision-rich gameplay that rewards smart plays and bold tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck from a diverse roster of powerful units and spells, each brought to life with stunning hand-animated <strong>pixel art</strong>. Position your forces on the battlefield, outthink your opponent, and strike with perfect precision. Whether you’re a returning Duelyst veteran or a newcomer to tactical card games, <strong>Blitz</strong> offers the perfect mix of accessibility and depth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029020/extras/6a37ae33c82763bcdc128138e4b89fd3.avif?t=1761073481\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ First truly<strong> cross-platform </strong>version of Duelyst. 📱 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iOS, Android  and Steam releases 🍎 🤖</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >improved client performance 🏃‍♀️</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >touch (swipe) gestures support ☝️</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 max mana, 60 seconds per turn ⏳</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >based on early Duelyst mechanics - 2 draw, no Bloodbound Spell 🧙</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all profit from Orb purchases goes back into advertising budget (ads, influencer marketing, prized tournaments) 💸</p></li></ul>",
